{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213410","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1521341001:0":{"text":"사냥의 신이 타락했다고 한탄하는 소리를 들었어요.","source_cn":"我听到你在哀叹狩猎神的陨落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C3013896844D637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521341002:0":{"text":"사냥의 신이 아니라 아쿠보르 때문에 한탄하는 거지!","source_cn":"不是哀叹狩猎神，是哀叹雅库伯尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DD2B12A59B21FD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521341003:0":{"text":"사냥의 신은 보칼리스인 하나를 위해서 아쿠보르를 버렸는데, 왜 한탄을 하겠어!","source_cn":"狩猎神为了一个呼临人，抛弃雅库伯尔，有什么好哀叹的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3F459954973BCB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521341004:0":{"text":"악독한 보칼리스인... 동족을 해치고 수많은 사람들의 목숨을 앗아갔으면서, 이젠 신까지 우리를 버리게 만들다니!","source_cn":"呼临人那样恶毒，戕害我们的同胞，害得多少人丧命，还害得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABCED2ED5D5A0B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521341005:0":{"text":"용서할 수 없어...!","source_cn":"真是不可原谅……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49E4F761E2AB25E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521341006:0":{"text":"그럼 혹시 아쿠보르인이 보칼리스인을 사랑하게 됐다면...","source_cn":"那么，如果有一个雅库伯尔人爱上了呼临人，你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x722AFB2C931FB3D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521341007:1":{"text":"...뭐? 보칼리스인을 사랑한다고?","source_cn":"——你说什么？爱上呼临人？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5D38B5954A5763F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521341008:1":{"text":"말도 안 돼! 숲의 표범이 비열한 쥐새끼를 사랑할 리가 없지!","source_cn":"怎么可能！丛林里的野豹怎么可能爱上一只卑劣的老鼠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92260AC308A469E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521341009:0":{"text":"그런 녀석이 있다면 당장 아쿠보르에서 추방해, 밀림의 뱀에게 밥으로 줘버리겠어!","source_cn":"要是真有那样的人，就该把他赶出雅库伯尔，扔到密林里喂蛇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BA07755C2C964E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:加拉":{"text":"갈라","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:轰":{"text":"쿵크","source":"轰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}